{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e903d6006945d280b1a9","chatId":"8531e6e753ea46b8a01d9f90651badbb","sessionId":null,"userId":69803,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":993,"promptTokens":1476,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069078108338714,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e903d6006945d280b1a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369795378,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e903d6006945d280b1a8","chatId":"8531e6e753ea46b8a01d9f90651badbb","sessionId":null,"userId":69803,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n经过几周的努力和决心，安迪终于可以开设他的展览并展出他的画像了。虽然他邀请了所有同事，但没有人出席。正当他准备收拾离开时，他的老板出现了，指着他的画作夸奖了他的技艺。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，安迪最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激 & 尴尬\nB) 感激 & 开心\nC) 尴尬 & 生气\nD) 气恼 & 生气\nE) 气恼 & 伤心\nF) 气恼 & 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n安迪为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 没有同事前来\nB) 他的老板出现并夸赞了他的作品\nC) 他不喜欢自己的画\nD) 他的同事不喜欢他的艺术作品","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069078108338714,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e903d6006945d280b1a9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369795376,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b837f75939314e5393002978bcd7aecd"}